there were about 900 students across eight different college campuses ranging from small, private, religious, non-religious, to large state universities as well. And at the end of this intro to psychology class, We asked them to complete a quiz about people is what we called it. And we gave them 40 different misconceptions about human psychology and behavior and just asked, what do they think? And did we actually dislodge any of these misconceptions after this course?

