again. And sometimes by sources that you think are maybe correct. Or Wikipedia, you know, which has all kinds of information in it, a lot of which is wrong. Yeah. I hate to jump on the bandwagon of just bashing social media, but it certainly doesn't help us in this context. And there's some really lovely research that points at how social media interactions really create these ideological echo chambers that serve to increase our moral outrage and our emotional experience, which is another influence on solidifying some of.

