students evaluate what artificial intelligence is saying. So using artificial intelligence both as a tool to say, okay, so what does artificial intelligence say about this thing? Now go read some research and have a conversation with artificial intelligence to see where is it may be correct and where is it maybe missing some critical nuance that will be really important to thinking through the bottom line that artificial intelligence is giving you. So I think that that's another form of active engagement. Given that science is iterative, are we sure that the beliefs we're talking about are truly

