I wish there was a pill that made me 50 times smarter and easier to remember and an exercise routine that made it possible for me not to sleep as much. Wouldn't that all be great? And because I, now I actually don't know if I want, those things. But if I did, I might be more willing to accept somebody, even somebody with credentials saying this is going to work all of these miracles in your life. And so as we are engaging information, it's really important to evaluate our emotional experience, whether it be a desire, like I really want this to be true. And sometimes those are hard to access because they are

